  "instructions": [
    "1. In a bowl, mix together flour, panko breadcrumbs, cornstarch, garam masala, salt, and pepper.",
    "2. Add the rasmalai to the bowl and mix until a crumbly mixture forms.",
    "3. Dip each shrimp into the mixture, pressing gently to coat.",
    "4. Heat oil in a deep frying pan to 350°F (175°C).",
    "5. Fry the coated shrimp in batches until golden brown, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "6. Remove the shrimp from oil and drain on paper towels.",
    "7. Serve the spicy shrimp rasmalai bites hot with a side of chutney or raita."
